<title>INDONESIA: Prasidha to issue bonus shares.</title>
<headline>Prasidha to issue bonus shares.</headline>
<dateline>SURABAYA, Indonesia 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesian trading firm PT Prasidha Aneka Niaga said on Monday it was planning an issue of bonus shares and a stock split to improve the liquidity of its stock.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement that the plans were subject to shareholder approval at a meeting on April 10, but gave no Prasidha was trading unchanged at 3,500 rupiah at the midsession break.</p>
